OL,3,GNEWSAMan crashed into pub after police
OL,4,Achase, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man died after he drove at speeds of
OL,7,Fup to 70mph during a police chase which
OL,8,Fended when he lost control and crashed
OL,9,Finto a pub, an inquest heard.
OL,11,FWill Place, 23, had been drinking in
OL,12,FRochdale, Greater Manchester, while
OL,13,Fwatching the England vs Slovakia match
OL,14,Fat Euro 2024. He got behind the wheel
OL,15,Fof his car at 03:00 BST the next day.
OL,17,FShortly after, police in a marked van
OL,18,Fsaw him pass a red light on Manchester
OL,19,FRoad and officers began a pursuit of
OL,20,Fthe car when it failed to stop.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
