OL,3,GNEWSAMan crashed into pub after police
OL,4,Achase, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FRochdale Coroner's Court was shown CCTV
OL,7,Ffootage of Place driving at speeds of
OL,8,Fup to 70mph through residential streets
OL,9,Fbefore police called off the chase. The
OL,10,Fjury heard he carried on driving before
OL,11,Fploughing into a pub.
